    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "CRASH-B004",
    "source_id": "HELP-CRASH-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "In many cases you can find the cause by reading Live Crash Reports and/or macOS System Crash Logs.",
