  {
    "kind": "h2",
    "text": "7. Requesting support",
    "body_html_line": 120,
    "anchor": "h_01HVVPEZ2R4577Q0W8NB1J560Z",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "7. Requesting support",
        "body_html_line": 120,
        "anchor": "h_01HVVPEZ2R4577Q0W8NB1J560Z"
      }
    ],
    "id": "CRASH-B071",
    "source_id": "HELP-CRASH-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "If you're unable to find the cause of Live crashing, submit a Crash Report along with your support request to Ableton Technical Support. In your support request, please include as many details as possible about how and when the crash happened.",
    "body_html_line": 121,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "7. Requesting support",
        "body_html_line": 120,
        "anchor": "h_01HVVPEZ2R4577Q0W8NB1J560Z"
      }
    ],
    "id": "CRASH-B072",
    "source_id": "HELP-CRASH-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Note: Sending a Crash Report to crashes@ableton.com allows us to analyze crash data. However, it does not create a support request, and you will not receive a reply unless you also contact Support.",
    "body_html_line": 122,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "7. Requesting support",
        "body_html_line": 120,
